messages[40]{user,text}:
  user_1,Umm... hi, is this Vikram from Omni? I wanted to talk about my life policy.
  user_2,Hey Rohan, yeah Vikram Patel here, Omni Insurance Group. Sure, what's up with your policy?
  user_1,[sighs] I just got a call that my policy might be cancelled? I'm kinda panicked.
  user_2,Whoa, let's not jump. Can you give me your policy number so I can pull it up?
  user_1,Yeah, it's LIF-2024-987654.
  user_2,[typing] One sec, let me check…
  user_2,[hold music] ...
  user_2,Alright, I see it here. Status shows 'Active' right now.
  user_1,Active? Then why did I get that call? Maybe a mistake?
  user_2,Probably a system glitch. Sometimes our outbound system flags things incorrectly.
  user_1,Okay, good. I also wanted to know if I can increase the sum assured.
  user_2,Sure thing. We can adjust that. Do you have a target amount in mind?
  user_1,Thinking about 15 lakh instead of 10 lakh.
  user_2,Got it. Let me run the numbers…
  user_2,[typing] …
  user_2,Alright, bumping it to 15 lakh will raise your premium by about ₹1,200 per month.
  user_1,Hmm, that's a bit higher than I expected.
  user_2,We could also look at a longer term or maybe a different rider to balance cost.
  user_1,Tell me about riders.
  user_2,We have a critical illness rider, accidental death benefit, and a waiver of premium rider.
  user_1,Accidental death sounds useful. How much extra would that be?
  user_2,For a ₹5 lakh accidental death rider, it's roughly ₹300 extra per month.
  user_1,Okay, maybe add that. Also, I need to update my address. It's changed.
  user_2,Sure, what's the new address?
  user_1,Flat 3B, Sunrise Apartments, 45 Park Street, Mumbai.
  user_2,Got it. Updating now…
  user_2,[typing] …
  user_2,All set. Your policy now reflects the new address.
  user_1,Great, thanks. One more thing – can I get a copy of the updated policy documents emailed to me?
  user_2,Absolutely. Which email should I send it to?
  user_1,rohan.deshmukh@example.com
  user_2,Sending now…
  user_2,[hold music] ...
  user_2,Email sent. Let me know if you don't see it in a few minutes.
  user_1,Will do. Oh, and by the way, how's the weather there?
  user_2,It's raining a bit here in Bangalore, but nice enough. How about Mumbai?
  user_1,Hot and humid as usual. [dog barks in background]
  user_2,Haha, typical. Anything else I can help with?
  user_1,No, that's all. Thanks for the help, Vikram.
  user_2,My pleasure, Rohan. Have a great day!